1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,768
From Unit 4, the maximum useful work a process can deliver equals delta G.

2
00:00:05,768 --> 00:00:13,216
A cell pushing n moles of electrons through a potential E does n F E of work on the surroundings.

3
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:19,830
Work done by the system is negative, so delta G equals minus n F E.

